# Hookpoint Registry (hok:// namespace)
# Authority: CSA-sealed

## 1. Canonical Hookpoint Contract

Hookpoints provide cross-cutting concerns for IPO pipeline without modifying core logic.

```yaml
hookpoint_contract:
  namespace: "hok://executor-py"
  phases: ["pre_input", "post_input", "pre_process", "post_process", "pre_output", "post_output", "on_error", "on_evidence"]
  binding: "fan_capability + hookpoint_id"
```

## 2. Executor-Py Hookpoints

```yaml
hookpoints:
  - id: "hok://executor-py/pre_input"
    phase: "pre_input"
    description: "Called before IPO.input() - normalize RAC URI, validate SIO"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 100

  - id: "hok://executor-py/post_input"
    phase: "post_input"
    description: "Called after IPO.input() - enrich ExecContext, inject trace"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 100

  - id: "hok://executor-py/pre_process"
    phase: "pre_process"
    description: "Called before Capor/Racor resolution - policy checks, quotas"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 200

  - id: "hok://executor-py/post_process"
    phase: "post_process"
    description: "Called after process() - route validation, machine selection"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 200

  - id: "hok://executor-py/pre_output"
    phase: "pre_output"
    description: "Called before IPO.output() - pre-finalize SIO envelope"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 100

  - id: "hok://executor-py/post_output"
    phase: "post_output"
    description: "Called after IPO.output() - finalize, seal evidence, dispatch"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 100

  - id: "hok://executor-py/on_error"
    phase: "on_error"
    description: "Called on any ExecuteError - logging, telemetry, recovery"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 300

  - id: "hok://executor-py/on_evidence"
    phase: "on_evidence"
    description: "Called when SepiProof is built - FEH/ALR sealing audit"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 300

  # FDI-specific hookpoints
  - id: "hok://executor-py/fdi/pre_autoload"
    phase: "pre_process"
    description: "Before FDI autoload - validate wire path"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 150

  - id: "hok://executor-py/fdi/post_autoload"
    phase: "post_process"
    description: "After FDI autoload - cache module, verify connection"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 150

  # FPI-specific hookpoints
  - id: "hok://executor-py/fpi/pre_discover"
    phase: "pre_process"
    description: "Before FPI discovery - scan wireless endpoints"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 150

  - id: "hok://executor-py/fpi/post_pair"
    phase: "post_process"
    description: "After FPI pairing - establish session, exchange keys"
    bound_handlers: []
    priority: 150
```

## 3. Binding Protocol

```yaml
binding_protocol:
  register:
    - "CSA approves hookpoint registration via hok://executor-py/{phase}/{name}"
    - "Handler MUST be a FanCapability registered in FanRegistry"
    - "Priority determines execution order (lower = earlier)"
  
  invoke:
    - "IpoOrchestrator calls hookpoints at each phase"
    - "Context passed: ExecContext, FanId, IpoInput/IpoProcess/IpoOutput"
    - "Handler returns modified context or raises ExecuteError"
  
  audit:
    - "Auditor verifies all hookpoint invocations produce ALR entries"
    - "FEH hash includes hookpoint execution trace"
```

